# Project bootstrap

## Commands

- Run PHP, Artisan, Composer, and Node through **`vendor/bin/sail`** (this app uses Laravel Sail).
- Prefer Laravel Boost MCP tools (`search-docs`, `database-schema`, `get-absolute-url`) over guessing framework APIs.

## Skills

- Activate the matching skill under **`.claude/skills/`** before work in that domain (Laravel PHP, Tailwind, testing, Cloud deploy, etc.).

## Rules in this repo

- **All conventions live in `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.** File-scoped rules auto-attach when matching paths are in context.
- For the full glob map, read **`.cursor/rules/README.md`** or `@rules-index` in chat.
- Cross-cutting topics: **`grep -rin 'keyword' .cursor/rules`**
- When a **specific glob rule** conflicts with an intelligent/cross-cutting rule, **follow the specific rule**.

## Recording new conventions

- Add or edit the relevant **`.mdc`** with correct `globs` and a concise body.
- Only when the **user explicitly asks** to record a rule — not as a summary of work you just did.
- Do **not** recreate `.ai/rules`; this repo uses Cursor rules only.

## Before editing code

- Read every **matching** `.mdc` for paths you will touch.
- Follow **`AGENTS.md`** Laravel Boost guidelines (Pint on dirty PHP, tests for behaviour changes).
